      "type": "text",
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 48.75,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "The unique constraint on (user_id, idempotency_key) is what makes purchases idempotent: a retry cannot insert a second order under\nthe same key, not even concurrently. The header is required, so nothing new is written without a key; the column stays nullable only\nbecause rows created before the change have NULL, and inventing keys for them would put fiction in the database.",
      "originalText": "The unique constraint on (user_id, idempotency_key) is what makes purchases idempotent: a retry cannot insert a second order under\nthe same key, not even concurrently. The header is required, so nothing new is written without a key; the column stays nullable only\nbecause rows created before the change have NULL, and inventing keys for them would put fiction in the database.",
