      "text": "status is one of PENDING | COMPLETED | FAILED. Orders are created COMPLETED (the model default) because a purchase settles\nsynchronously; the other two are there for a future payment step. accounts/ defines no model — AUTH_USER_MODEL is Django's built-in\nUser.",
